nty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in May to June in 40 of 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the middle ran 187% of normal in May to June and 43% in November to December. So far in 2026, the middle sits at 46% for January to February and 126% for June to July. Grid 13936 had its driest year in 1963 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
